<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield cricket standings</p>
<p>after matches completed on Monday (tabulate under played, won</p>
<p>outright, won on first innings, drawn, lost on first innings,</p>
<p>lost outright, points):</p>
<p> Queensland		4   3   1   0   0   0   20</p>
<p> Western Australia     4   2   1   0   0   1   14</p>
<p> New South Wales	 5   2   1   0   1   1   13.8</p>
<p> Tasmania		  4   1   1   0   1   1    8</p>
<p> Victoria		  5   1   0   0   1   3    5.7</p>
<p> South Australia	 4   0   0   0   1   3    0</p>
<p>Note: New South Wales penalised 0.2 points for slow over</p>
<p>rate in their match against Tasmania, Victoria penalised 0.3</p>
<p>points for the same reason in the game against New South Wales.</p>
</text>
